### Acceptance criteria:

button to open the cart with following criteria :

* cart with free delivery inprogress
* cart with free delivery completed 
* empty cart 
* cart with coupon added 

### **Technical Details:**

_**organisms/Cart/CartListItem**_

```
interface CartListItemProps {
  productId: string;
  href: string;
  image: Media;
  flags?: { text: string; variant: 'promo' | 'sale' | 'new' }[];
  brand?: string;
  brandHref?: string;
  title: string;
  subtitle?: string;
  price: Money;
  strikethroughPrice?: Money;
  unitPrice?: Money;
  measurementUnit?: string;
  quantityPicker : QuantityPickerProps;
  discounts? : DiscountFlagProps;
} 
```

* create new atom `DiscountFlag`
* emit quantity value to the parent
* use `LuiText` , `LuiQuantityPicker` , `LuiProductFlag` , `LuiMedia`

